# os-rice/windows-rice/rices/default/rice.list — which modules this rice
# installs, in order. Mirrors ../../../rices/<name>/rice.list: a plain list,
# # comments, one name per line; manifest order is the dependency order
# (nothing here depends on anything else yet, but the convention carries over
# from the Linux side).
#
# Each name must have a windows.map entry (the package) and a
# ../../modules/<name>.ps1 (the package + config layer).

pwsh
wezterm
oh-my-posh
fastfetch
